Package: islhepi
Title: Epidemiological Methods for Island Health
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("Temuulen", "Enebish", , "temuulen@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides validated helpers for common applied epidemiology
    tasks, including surveillance event checks, complete period counts,
    descriptive baselines and current-window summaries, age grouping, crude
    and directly standardised rates, Poisson confidence intervals, small-cell
    suppression and count rounding. It also retrieves standardized population
    denominators and health-geography boundaries from pinned BC Data Catalogue
    records. Methods are explicit and designed for reproducible public health
    analysis.
